1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 36=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:14,080
Keep your wrist straight.

7
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,430
Don't let it droop.

8
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,870
And don't bend it upward.

9
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:27,590
Aim.

10
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,400
Once you've taken aim,

11
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:32,910
don't overthink it.

12
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,560
Keep your hand steady.

13
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,190
Keep your elbow straight

14
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,630
and locked in place.

15
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,560
Don't let it shake.

16
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:50,460
♪Hardship will always remain♪

17
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:55,540
♪Amid treacherous waters,
few make it to the end♪

18
00:02:55,900 --> 00:03:00,750
♪How could a thousand words
soothe this aching heart?♪

19
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:03,030
I'm not trying to take advantage of you.

20
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:06,750
I just don't have any strength left.

21
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,470
I know.

22
00:03:13,340 --> 00:03:18,780
♪Even if I only illuminate
a single corner♪

23
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:23,860
♪If I could bring light
to someone's eyes♪

24
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:32,340
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

25
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,800
Wei Bao and his men
are seasoned soldiers.

26
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,470
They'll find this place eventually.

27
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,710
Don't worry about me.

28
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,840
Get on the mule and go.

29
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,360
Where would I go?

30
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,630
If I survive,

31
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,470
we'll meet again as husband and wife.

32
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:15,590
If I die,

33
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,310
you should remarry.

34
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:27,040
I used my power to get my way

35
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,510
and took you from Han Liang

36
00:04:31,630 --> 00:04:34,190
against your will.

37
00:04:35,950 --> 00:04:37,430
I wronged you.

38
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,600
Now,

39
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:44,310
Han Liang still isn't betrothed,

40
00:04:46,190 --> 00:04:48,310
and you still can't forget him.

41
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,310
You should marry him.

42
00:04:56,824 --> 00:04:58,630
I've never thought
about Han Liang that way.

43
00:04:58,904 --> 00:05:00,950
How could I possibly
still have feelings for him?

44
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,120
You never

45
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,720
had feelings for Han Liang?

46
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,920
Lin Jinqi.

47
00:05:25,464 --> 00:05:27,000
You used your power to get your way

48
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:27,992
and took what you wanted.

49
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,090
You're not wrong about that.

50
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,950
But this has nothing
to do with Han Liang.

51
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:36,000
What you took from me

52
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,600
was my life.

53
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,040
You ignored what I wanted

54
00:05:40,456 --> 00:05:41,720
and used an imperial decree

55
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,920
to bind me to the Lin family.

56
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,600
Back then,

57
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,750
when you helped me register Ji'er,

58
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,430
I made you a promise.

59
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:00,630
If you ever needed my help,

60
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,190
I would do everything in my power.

61
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,190
Besides,

62
00:06:19,352 --> 00:06:20,950
our marriage was decreed by the Emperor.

63
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,720
How could I possibly remarry?

64
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:30,000
I'll write a memorial

65
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:32,920
asking His Majesty

66
00:06:34,430 --> 00:06:35,830
to allow you to remarry.

67
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,390
By then,

68
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:42,510
who knows which emperor

69
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:43,920
will be sitting on the throne?

70
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:49,240
If it's Prince Han,

71
00:06:50,830 --> 00:06:52,630
I'll just have to be beheaded with you.

72
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,560
All right.

73
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:03,830
Stop imagining the worst.

74
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,920
If you have the energy,
you should eat something.

75
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:14,800
I brought you hot water,

76
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:16,120
but it froze.

77
00:07:22,168 --> 00:07:23,070
The flatbread is hard.

78
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:25,032
Let it soften in your mouth
before you eat it.

79
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,390
Why

80
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,160
didn't you boil a couple of eggs?

81
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:42,190
Young Master Lin,

82
00:07:42,510 --> 00:07:44,040
in weather this cold,

83
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,390
hens don't lay eggs.

84
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,950
For an ordinary farming family,

85
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,600
even this little brown sugar

86
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:52,024
is something they only buy
when a woman has just given birth.

87
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,030
You're even hotter now.

88
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,910
I'll go see if I can find

89
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,630
any herbs to bring down your fever.

90
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:39,960
Let go of me!

91
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,910
Help!

92
00:09:56,312 --> 00:09:58,568
You wretched woman! You don't
know what's good for you!

93
00:09:58,728 --> 00:10:00,280
You're overestimating yourself!

94
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,480
You've ruined my fun!

95
00:10:17,170 --> 00:10:18,050
Women in the capital

96
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:19,840
could get us killed
just for looking at them,

97
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,390
let alone touching them.

98
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:23,120
We're in luck today.

99
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,440
Let's have our fill of fun.

100
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:25,750
My turn.

101
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:28,550
Here I come.

102
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:37,870
You beasts! I'll kill you!

103
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,550
Come on!

104
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:47,750
I'll kill you!

105
00:10:49,224 --> 00:10:50,270
Is that all you've got?

106
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,000
I'm fine.

107
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,390
She's just a woman.

108
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,000
You beast!

109
00:11:03,630 --> 00:11:04,870
Still putting up a fight, huh?

110
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,440
I'll make you regret it today!

111
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,720
You beast! I'll kill you!

112
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:11,670
Come on!

113
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:13,120
Kill me.

114
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,910
Go ahead and kill me!

115
00:11:15,510 --> 00:11:16,750
Let's see what you've got.

116
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,360
Come on.

117
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:25,600
You said you'd kill me.
Still putting up a fight?

118
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,390
I'll make you regret it today!

119
00:11:27,550 --> 00:11:28,630
Sweetheart.

120
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,480
Come kill me!

121
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:40,080
Who's there?

122
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:41,320
Who is it?

123
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:57,840
As you wish.

124
00:11:58,790 --> 00:12:00,440
I'll kill you.

125
00:12:52,910 --> 00:12:53,720
Madam Dai.

126
00:12:54,216 --> 00:12:55,390
What are you doing here?

127
00:13:01,816 --> 00:13:03,630
Why are you dressed
like this, Madam Lin?

128
00:13:04,632 --> 00:13:06,000
Have you become a servant again?

129
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:19,260
(Tiance Guards)

130
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:27,840
Prince Han has been defeated.

131
00:13:36,808 --> 00:13:38,840
You and Zhao Xingluo
fled the capital,

132
00:13:38,872 --> 00:13:40,616
only to run
into bandits one after another.

133
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,550
They took everything you had.

134
00:13:54,550 --> 00:13:55,720
Just as you said,

135
00:13:57,550 --> 00:13:58,840
the Zhao family is finished.

136
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,000
The Dai family is finished, too.

137
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:04,000
It's all over.

138
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,360
After Prince Han's defeat,

139
00:15:04,184 --> 00:15:06,320
his remaining troops
will scatter in all directions,

140
00:15:06,712 --> 00:15:08,080
robbing, burning, and killing.

141
00:15:08,488 --> 00:15:10,440
They'll be even
more vicious than real bandits.

142
00:15:11,384 --> 00:15:13,256
You should leave
this place as soon as possible

143
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:14,750
and find somewhere to hide.

144
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,670
This is where we part.

145
00:15:21,208 --> 00:15:22,504
May our paths never cross again.

146
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:46,240
Go wherever you want.

147
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:47,630
Stop following me.

148
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,030
Madam Lin.

149
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:54,080
It's freezing out here.

150
00:16:54,630 --> 00:16:55,720
Where can I possibly go?

151
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,720
Go wherever you like.

152
00:16:59,016 --> 00:17:00,080
Just stop following me.

153
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,310
What a coincidence.

154
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,960
We've run into
each other again, Madam Lin.

155
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:20,960
It seems

156
00:17:21,704 --> 00:17:23,240
we happen to be going the same way.

157
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:55,440
Lanxiang.

158
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:01,070
Lanxiang.

159
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:15,720
Wait for me.

160
00:18:17,830 --> 00:18:18,880
I can't keep up.

161
00:18:46,070 --> 00:18:46,640
So...

162
00:18:47,830 --> 00:18:49,310
you dressed worse than a servant

163
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,440
all for this ungrateful man.

164
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:55,200
Take my advice.

165
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:57,960
Men

166
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,480
are no good.

167
00:19:01,070 --> 00:19:03,110
Stop giving him your whole heart.

168
00:19:55,752 --> 00:19:57,000
Do you have anything to eat?

169
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:27,160
Next time I have to flee,

170
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,510
I'll know better.

171
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:30,590
I can't just bring money.

172
00:20:31,128 --> 00:20:32,480
I'll need to bring some food, too.

173
00:20:34,070 --> 00:20:35,510
In times of war and chaos,

174
00:20:36,350 --> 00:20:38,110
even money can't buy you food.

175
00:20:49,510 --> 00:20:50,880
There's one thing you got wrong.

176
00:20:53,688 --> 00:20:55,160
I didn't keep running into bandits.

177
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,400
Xingluo and I

178
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,400
were abandoned by Master Zhao

179
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:04,960
and Young Master Zhao

180
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:07,240
halfway through our journey.

181
00:21:19,830 --> 00:21:21,310
They thought we

182
00:21:22,350 --> 00:21:23,400
were a burden.

183
00:21:26,110 --> 00:21:27,310
They killed Qingxiang,

184
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,880
took my money,

185
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,680
and fled.

186
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:34,480
But guess what?

187
00:21:35,830 --> 00:21:38,070
Xingluo and I

188
00:21:38,168 --> 00:21:39,608
actually came across Master Zhao

189
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:41,768
and Young Master Zhao's
bodies along the way.

190
00:21:43,110 --> 00:21:45,270
They died even before I did.

191
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:13,720
Thank you for killing
the men who humiliated me

192
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:17,350
and giving me bean cakes to eat.

193
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:55,200
I have nothing left now.

194
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,110
I'll give this to you.

195
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:09,070
No one in the Lin family is any good.

196
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:10,830
Keep this,

197
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:13,432
and you'll have something
to protect yourself with.

198
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:16,590
Never mind Lin Jinqi.

199
00:23:17,550 --> 00:23:19,000
Even Lin Zhaoxiang

200
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,590
would get down on his knees

201
00:23:21,750 --> 00:23:22,920
if you told him to.

202
00:23:27,590 --> 00:23:28,720
You don't believe me?

203
00:23:35,830 --> 00:23:37,960
This is evidence
of Lin Jinqi's rebellion.

204
00:23:39,590 --> 00:23:41,270
Master Zhao and Young Master Zhao

205
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:42,880
came all the way to the capital

206
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:45,160
to present this evidence

207
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:47,550
and claim credit from Old Master Zhao.

208
00:23:49,030 --> 00:23:52,000
Unfortunately, Prince Han
launched his rebellion.

209
00:23:52,590 --> 00:23:55,110
Old Master Zhao remained
in the imperial palace

210
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,440
and never returned.

211
00:23:58,590 --> 00:23:59,510
The father and son

212
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:00,640
thought I was still

213
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:02,400
an illiterate fool.

214
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,270
They let their guard down,

215
00:24:06,270 --> 00:24:07,750
so I secretly saw it.

216
00:24:12,328 --> 00:24:14,440
When news came that
Prince Han had been defeated,

217
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:15,720
we all

218
00:24:15,830 --> 00:24:17,510
fled the capital in a hurry.

219
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:22,720
Master Zhao and Young Master Zhao

220
00:24:22,830 --> 00:24:23,880
died along the way.

221
00:24:24,830 --> 00:24:25,550
I hid

222
00:24:27,070 --> 00:24:28,480
this away.

223
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:31,480
I thought I could
either use it to save my life,

224
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,640
or

225
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:36,110
even if I died,

226
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:39,070
I'd make sure the Lin family

227
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,110
went down with me.

228
00:25:18,790 --> 00:25:20,070
You never would've guessed it.

229
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:26,200
Lin Jinqi really
was the wolf among them.

230
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:28,920
He actually had the audacity

231
00:25:29,790 --> 00:25:32,070
to secretly let
the deposed Crown Prince escape.

232
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:35,750
About this,

233
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:36,750
in this entire world,

234
00:25:37,384 --> 00:25:38,680
you're the only one who knows.

235
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:44,960
Why are you giving this to me?

236
00:26:17,550 --> 00:26:18,550
I told you.

237
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:24,110
Because you killed the men
who humiliated me

238
00:26:27,830 --> 00:26:29,310
and gave me bean cakes to eat.

239
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:44,008
But you don't seem like someone
who repays kindness with kindness.

240
00:27:04,070 --> 00:27:05,160
I'm not.

241
00:27:06,830 --> 00:27:08,440
But when death is near,

242
00:27:09,656 --> 00:27:11,070
people tend to speak from the heart.

243
00:28:00,830 --> 00:28:03,070
I don't want to die
alongside those beasts.

244
00:28:04,750 --> 00:28:06,110
Spending my final moments with you

245
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:10,110
isn't so bad.

246
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:16,480
Zhao...

247
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:21,720
What should I call you?

248
00:28:24,350 --> 00:28:26,270
Can I call you Xingtang?

249
00:28:33,790 --> 00:28:36,310
You understand me
even better than Qingxiang did.

250
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,550
All my life,

251
00:28:53,832 --> 00:28:54,880
I've been Young Lady Zhao,

252
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:55,830
and Madam Dai.

253
00:28:57,270 --> 00:28:58,510
I've had enough.

254
00:29:01,550 --> 00:29:02,790
I've truly had enough.

255
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,200
When I die,

256
00:29:05,550 --> 00:29:07,440
just burn me to ashes.

257
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:13,160
In my next life,

258
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:15,750
I want to be myself,

259
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:18,510
my own person.

260
00:29:19,592 --> 00:29:20,350
Do you understand?

261
00:29:23,110 --> 00:29:23,750
I do.

262
00:29:25,176 --> 00:29:26,240
I understand everything.

263
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:34,720
I've learned to read.

264
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:37,310
I've studied.

265
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,110
But

266
00:29:42,824 --> 00:29:44,110
I still don't understand...

267
00:29:45,750 --> 00:29:47,720
Don't understand
the rules of this world.

268
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:49,720
Tell me,

269
00:29:50,830 --> 00:29:52,030
when will there

270
00:29:53,510 --> 00:29:55,480
ever be a world like that?

271
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:58,240
Where girls, just like boys,

272
00:29:58,590 --> 00:29:59,920
can go to school,

273
00:30:01,816 --> 00:30:03,240
take the imperial examinations,

274
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:04,790
serve as officials,

275
00:30:05,480 --> 00:30:06,350
do business,

276
00:30:06,936 --> 00:30:08,030
and earn their own money.

277
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:11,920
Where women

278
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:14,550
can choose their own husbands,

279
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:18,790
without marriages arranged
by parents and matchmakers.

280
00:30:19,608 --> 00:30:21,440
Where a wife doesn't have
to obey her husband.

281
00:30:21,896 --> 00:30:23,464
She doesn't have to obey her husband

282
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:25,160
or her son.

283
00:30:26,480 --> 00:30:27,550
She is simply herself.

284
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:33,030
There will be.

285
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:39,110
That world will come one day.

286
00:30:47,310 --> 00:30:49,270
If such a world truly existed,

287
00:30:50,160 --> 00:30:51,160
that would be wonderful.

288
00:30:53,790 --> 00:30:56,350
Then Qingxiang and I could

289
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,960
earn our living openly

290
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:02,880
and live with dignity.

291
00:31:15,270 --> 00:31:16,070
Lanxiang.

292
00:31:17,750 --> 00:31:19,400
Keep this evidence safe.

293
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:23,440
The Lin family won't dare mistreat you.

294
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:26,140
♪If there were a promise♪

295
00:31:26,620 --> 00:31:30,660
♪I could still turn down with a smile♪

296
00:31:31,100 --> 00:31:34,980
♪Sadly, my wish could not come true♪

297
00:31:35,590 --> 00:31:36,680
Live well.

298
00:31:39,300 --> 00:31:41,260
♪Those things I can't forget♪

299
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,790
Live well...

300
00:31:42,790 --> 00:31:45,700
♪The absurdities
I can't let go of fill every page♪

301
00:31:45,700 --> 00:31:47,700
♪Building a wall♪

302
00:31:47,700 --> 00:31:51,300
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

303
00:31:51,300 --> 00:31:54,780
♪Drifting with the wind♪

304
00:31:56,020 --> 00:31:58,220
♪Memories hide away again♪

305
00:31:58,220 --> 00:31:59,900
♪Silent, yet♪

306
00:31:59,900 --> 00:32:02,860
♪They never stop shining♪

307
00:32:02,860 --> 00:32:04,740
♪Still burning bright♪

308
00:32:04,740 --> 00:32:07,820
♪That's what made me who I am♪

309
00:32:07,820 --> 00:32:11,900
♪The best days of my life♪

310
00:32:12,540 --> 00:32:16,820
♪Etched into my heart♪

311
00:32:30,740 --> 00:32:34,260
♪If there were a promise♪

312
00:32:34,740 --> 00:32:38,580
♪I could still turn down with a smile♪

313
00:32:39,180 --> 00:32:43,100
♪Sadly, my wish could not come true♪

314
00:32:43,300 --> 00:32:46,940
♪Yet I must still smile through it all♪

315
00:32:46,940 --> 00:32:49,420
♪Those things I can't forget♪

316
00:32:49,420 --> 00:32:53,660
♪The absurdities
I can't let go of fill every page♪

317
00:32:53,660 --> 00:32:55,580
♪Building a wall♪

318
00:32:55,940 --> 00:32:59,420
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

319
00:32:59,420 --> 00:33:02,900
♪Drifting with the wind♪

320
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:57,000
(On this journey to the capital,)

321
00:33:58,160 --> 00:34:01,000
(being at the Emperor's side
is like being beside a tiger.)

322
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:03,200
(I fear that one day,)

323
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:07,000
(the Lin family may face extermination)

324
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:09,110
(because of you.)

325
00:34:09,528 --> 00:34:11,160
(Though I may be an unworthy grandson,)

326
00:34:11,360 --> 00:34:13,760
(I have never done anything
to disgrace our family.)

327
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:17,150
(Do you dare swear before our ancestors)

328
00:34:17,230 --> 00:34:21,280
(that you've never deceived
the Emperor or defied his authority?)

329
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:26,590
(I conducted secret
investigations day and night)

330
00:34:26,616 --> 00:34:28,360
(and finally obtained
conclusive evidence.)

331
00:34:28,392 --> 00:34:30,110
(Father's suspicions were correct.)

332
00:34:30,190 --> 00:34:32,670
(The man Lin Jinqi took away
from the Furong Troupe)

333
00:34:32,824 --> 00:34:34,440
(was indeed the deposed Crown Prince.)

334
00:34:34,670 --> 00:34:36,230
(The two conspired in secret,)

335
00:34:36,280 --> 00:34:38,320
(and Lin Jinqi
helped him escape by sea.)

336
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:41,590
(We personally interrogated the boatmen)

337
00:34:41,590 --> 00:34:42,760
(and porters involved.)

338
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:44,480
(There is no risk of this being leaked.)

339
00:34:44,590 --> 00:34:46,920
(Li Qi, a coroner with
the Western City Patrol Office,)

340
00:34:46,920 --> 00:34:48,800
(recovered a floating corpse
west of the city)

341
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,960
(in June of that same year.)

342
00:34:49,976 --> 00:34:52,500
(Though it was reported as
an accidental drowning while drunk,)

343
00:34:52,510 --> 00:34:54,920
(the examination found
no foam around the mouth or nose)

344
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,280
(and no water in the stomach.)

345
00:34:56,290 --> 00:34:58,650
(The victim was killed
before being thrown into the water.)

346
00:34:58,660 --> 00:34:59,580
(Even more strangely,)

347
00:34:59,590 --> 00:35:02,320
(the corpse was missing
its left index finger.)

348
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:06,840
(Lin Jinqi's guilt is now established.)

349
00:35:49,230 --> 00:35:50,670
Lin Jinqi.

350
00:36:30,660 --> 00:36:39,580
(Lin Jinqi's guilt is now established.)

351
00:37:38,630 --> 00:37:39,320
Xingtang.

352
00:37:41,880 --> 00:37:43,710
I burned the gift

353
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:45,230
you gave me,

354
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,960
but I won't let
your kindness go to waste.

355
00:37:52,550 --> 00:37:53,960
I'll make sure I live well.

356
00:38:30,030 --> 00:38:31,360
Your wound must hurt.

357
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,440
Hold on a little longer.

358
00:38:35,448 --> 00:38:36,670
Outside, things are now...

359
00:38:40,070 --> 00:38:41,280
You're finally awake.

360
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:46,880
I have good news for you.

361
00:38:48,070 --> 00:38:49,960
The Emperor defeated Prince Han.

362
00:38:56,670 --> 00:38:57,360
What's wrong?

363
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,000
I'm speechless with joy.

364
00:39:12,280 --> 00:39:13,630
Congratulations, Young Master Lin.

365
00:39:14,070 --> 00:39:15,440
Your head

366
00:39:16,070 --> 00:39:16,920
is safe.

367
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:21,920
Is there anything

368
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,880
you want to say to me?

369
00:39:39,230 --> 00:39:40,400
That's Xingtang.

370
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,360
She

371
00:39:44,480 --> 00:39:45,070
died.

372
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:52,230
Is there anything else

373
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:54,840
you want to say to me?

374
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:56,840
It's very chaotic outside now.

375
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,670
Prince Han's remaining troops

376
00:39:59,030 --> 00:40:00,110
have turned to banditry.

377
00:40:01,280 --> 00:40:03,230
Xingtang was unfortunate enough
to encounter them

378
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:05,190
and was badly wounded.

379
00:40:06,072 --> 00:40:08,280
She struggled on with me
until we reached this place,

380
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:11,760
but she couldn't hold on any longer.

381
00:40:15,590 --> 00:40:16,510
Anything else?

382
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:19,880
What else is there?

383
00:40:34,940 --> 00:40:37,300
♪Look at us♪

384
00:40:38,020 --> 00:40:42,260
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

385
00:40:43,860 --> 00:40:48,780
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

386
00:40:50,230 --> 00:40:51,030
And

387
00:40:54,480 --> 00:40:56,000
I will spend my entire life

388
00:40:56,880 --> 00:40:57,670
remembering

389
00:40:58,840 --> 00:41:01,110
that you saved my life.

390
00:41:02,300 --> 00:41:05,260
♪There will always
be someone to share it with♪

391
00:41:05,260 --> 00:41:08,180
♪Our bond runs deep♪

392
00:41:08,660 --> 00:41:12,140
♪Binding us closely together♪

393
00:41:12,540 --> 00:41:15,500
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

394
00:41:15,500 --> 00:41:19,300
♪This love has
never faded in the slightest♪

395
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:23,590
Wei.

396
00:41:24,230 --> 00:41:25,360
Since you're already here,

397
00:41:26,030 --> 00:41:27,670
why bother hiding?

398
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:43,440
You must have heard by now

399
00:41:44,110 --> 00:41:45,510
that Prince Han has been defeated.

400
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:47,150
Your head will make a fitting offering

401
00:41:47,150 --> 00:41:48,400
to honor Prince Han!

402
00:41:55,590 --> 00:41:57,190
You have the advantage in numbers.

403
00:41:58,070 --> 00:41:59,550
I'm in no condition to resist.

404
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:02,110
But I have a few words to say.

405
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:04,070
Please let me finish.

406
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:06,630
Speak.

407
00:42:07,920 --> 00:42:09,760
I helped His Majesty ascend the throne,

408
00:42:10,400 --> 00:42:12,400
and I'm one of his trusted ministers.

409
00:42:12,630 --> 00:42:13,760
Today,

410
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:16,440
you could certainly kill me
and walk away.

411
00:42:17,030 --> 00:42:18,630
But what about your parents,

412
00:42:18,952 --> 00:42:20,030
your wife and children,

413
00:42:20,840 --> 00:42:21,920
and the rest of your family?

414
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:24,960
They can't escape.

415
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:26,510
When the time comes,

416
00:42:26,960 --> 00:42:29,400
they'll surely pay with their lives
for what you've done.

417
00:42:30,888 --> 00:42:32,630
The winners rule.
The losers pay the price.

418
00:42:33,224 --> 00:42:34,360
I accept the consequences.

419
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:45,630
You're still in the prime of your life,

420
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:48,360
and a fine man at that.

421
00:42:49,230 --> 00:42:51,510
Are you really willing
to become an outlaw,

422
00:42:52,232 --> 00:42:54,580
spend the rest of your life robbing,
burning, and killing,

423
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:56,510
bring shame upon your ancestors,

424
00:42:56,744 --> 00:42:58,900
and leave no descendants
to carry on your family line?

425
00:42:58,920 --> 00:42:59,760
Captain Wei.

426
00:43:05,380 --> 00:43:07,500
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

427
00:43:14,190 --> 00:43:15,710
We're both still young.

428
00:43:20,190 --> 00:43:21,760
We have plenty of time

429
00:43:23,670 --> 00:43:25,440
to truly get to know each other.

430
00:43:39,880 --> 00:43:41,030
Between you and me,

431
00:43:42,150 --> 00:43:43,880
there are too many barriers.

432
00:43:45,550 --> 00:43:46,710
You and I

433
00:43:48,392 --> 00:43:49,576
walk different paths.

434
00:44:05,981 --> 00:44:10,101
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

435
00:44:12,941 --> 00:44:17,461
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

436
00:44:18,741 --> 00:44:22,661
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

437
00:44:23,341 --> 00:44:26,101
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

438
00:44:26,821 --> 00:44:29,141
♪Though all the world may fade♪

439
00:44:29,141 --> 00:44:32,221
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

440
00:44:33,741 --> 00:44:37,981
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

441
00:44:40,901 --> 00:44:45,061
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

442
00:44:46,861 --> 00:44:50,421
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

443
00:44:50,421 --> 00:44:53,981
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

444
00:44:54,781 --> 00:45:00,461
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

445
00:45:00,821 --> 00:45:05,141
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

446
00:45:05,501 --> 00:45:08,461
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

447
00:45:08,461 --> 00:45:12,221
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

448
00:45:12,221 --> 00:45:15,101
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

449
00:45:15,101 --> 00:45:19,181
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

450
00:45:19,181 --> 00:45:22,541
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

451
00:45:22,541 --> 00:45:26,301
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

452
00:45:26,301 --> 00:45:30,301
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

